# Practice safety checks

::: rating Rate your confidence with the exit plan {style=stars}
1. I need help
2. I can find one exit
3. I can find both exits
:::

::: rating Rate how ready you feel to respond {style=slider}
1. I need help
2. I need more practice
3. I can follow the plan
4. I can guide a coworker
:::

::: free-response Write your personal action plan {private download=both required}
Name one exit you will check today and when you will check it.
:::
